{'symbol': 'REGN', 'date': '2022-12-23 08:30:00', 'title': 'LIBTAYO® (CEMIPLIMAB) APPROVED IN JAPAN FOR ADVANCED OR RECURRENT CERVICAL CANCER', 'text': 'TARRYTOWN, N.Y. , DEC. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REGENERON PHARMACEUTICALS (NASDAQ: REGN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE MINISTRY OF HEALTH, LABOR AND WELFARE (MHLW) IN JAPAN HAS GRANTED MARKETING AND MANUFACTURING AUTHORIZATION FOR LIBTAYO® (CEMIPLIMAB) AS MONOTHERAPY TO TREAT PATIENTS WITH ADVANCED OR RECURRENT CERVICAL CANCER WHOSE DISEASE PROGRESSED AFTER CHEMOTHERAPY.'}